        "garden suite",
        "coach house"
      ],
      "source": "City of Surrey: Planning Reports",
      "jurisdiction": "Surrey",
      "type": "council",
      "note": "A six-unit SSMUH proposal at 13003 Old Yale Road combining a houseplex, a garden suite and a coach house. Staff recommend the application be referred back rather than supported: the requested setback variances do not comply with the Urban Residential (R3) zone, and staff want it revised to fit. A useful case of the distance between what SSMUH zoning permits and what a particular lot will actually carry."
    },
